WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.005
Experiments cover three core tasks.

00:00:05.085 --> 00:00:10.090
Image segmentation uses subsets of SA-1B ranging
from one to ten percent;

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:15.175
human pose estimation uses the full COCO-Pose
dataset; image deraining uses Rain13K.

00:00:15.255 --> 00:00:20.260
Validation relies on held-out SA-1B splits together
with MPII and Test2800.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:25.345
The distilled models are also benchmarked on Pascal
five-i foreground segmentation using mean intersection-over-union,

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:30.430
and the practical eighty-million model is evaluated
on ImageNet classification.

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:35.515
Throughout,

00:00:35.595 --> 00:00:40.600
the VQGAN tokenizer is trained on the Laion dataset
and used off the shelf.
